    <string name="settings_reconnect_grace_detail_description">Many cars switch Bluetooth off and straight back on while you get out. Keep recording for a while after the connection drops, and reconnecting to the same vehicle continues the same ride instead of starting a new one. Whatever was recorded in between is discarded if the car does not come back.</string>
